flowchart TD
  U[User] -- "login · MFA · passkey" --> IDP[Identity provider · OIDC<br/>users · refresh tokens, hashed]
  IDP -. publishes signing keys .-> JWKS[JWKS endpoint]
  U -- "access token" --> GW[Gateway<br/>verifies with cached keys]
  GW --> S[Services<br/>talk to each other over mTLS]
  S -. "can X edit doc 7?" .-> PS[Permission service<br/>relationship tuples · cache]
